"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363460/extras/7bb2ef0d62701d9d45303048f5519d1a.poster.avif?t=1755020262\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363460/extras/7bb2ef0d62701d9d45303048f5519d1a.webm?t=1755020262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363460/extras/7bb2ef0d62701d9d45303048f5519d1a.mp4?t=1755020262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Soundtrack:</strong> Experience music that adapts to the intensity of combat, shifting tempo and tone to match your performance and enhance every moment of the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ongoing Updates &amp; Expansion: STAND: Sins of the Immortals</strong> launches in <strong>Early Access</strong> and will continuously grow. Expect <strong>regular content updates</strong> \u2013 new modes, enemy types, weapons, and the much-anticipated <strong>online co-op mode</strong> \u2013 all shaped by community feedback. The journey doesn\u2019t end at launch; it\u2019s just beginning.</p>",
    "short_description": "Rise as a cursed immortal bound to an endless war against a relentless horde. Witness every drop of blood and shattered bone in brutal 3D combat with realistic visuals. Unlock new powers through real-time skill upgrades. Whether alone or with allies, only one thing matters\u2014how long can you STAND.",
